Package: capsa-core
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: embedding-based document storage and retrieval CLI
 capsa indexes documents and queries a libSQL vector database using an
 OpenAI-compatible embedding service. This package contains only the capsa
 command-line program; it does not install a service, database, models, or
 embedding credentials.
